### backward jump: loopbig 0f 00 54 <off40>
  back-edge @+0x138 : 0f0054fafeffffffff00
  off40 = -262 (signed). instr@0x138, target≈0x3c (instr+len+off)
  baseline (n=7): out= 1545
  offset zeroed -> status=CMDBUF_ERROR  
